{"meta":{"id":"ng-custom-pipe-directive","title":"Viết custom pipe và custom directive — Renderer2, ElementRef, host binding; ví dụ bạn từng viết?","track":"angular","topic":"templates","tags":["pipe","directive","renderer2","elementref"],"type":"question","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":7,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-09","ng_version":"22","private":false,"related":["ng-pure-impure-pipe","ng-core-host-bindings","ng-structural-vs-attribute"],"srs":true,"sources":["interviews.txt"],"layer":"theory","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-09","ngVersion":"22"},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Tìm hiểu custom pipe, Renderer2, ElementRef, directive (HostBinding, HostListener). Cho ví dụ bạn từng viết.</p>\n"},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Ví dụ tôi hay viết: pipe <strong><code>maskAccount</code></strong> che số tài khoản, pipe <strong><code>vnd</code></strong> định dạng tiền theo quy ước nội bộ; directive <strong><code>appAmountInput</code></strong> tự chèn dấu phân cách khi gõ, <strong><code>appAutofocus</code></strong> focus ô đầu tiên khi mở form, <strong><code>appCopy</code></strong> sao chép mã giao dịch. Nguyên tắc: pipe phải <strong>thuần</strong> và rẻ; directive gắn hành vi qua <strong><code>host</code> metadata</strong> thay vì <code>@HostBinding</code>/<code>@HostListener</code>. <code>ElementRef</code> cho tham chiếu tới phần tử, nhưng <strong>sửa DOM trực tiếp</strong> qua <code>nativeElement</code> thì vỡ khi SSR và vượt qua cơ chế sanitize. <code>Renderer2</code> là lớp trừu tượng an toàn hơn khi buộc phải thao tác DOM từ code — còn những gì <code>host</code> làm được thì dùng <code>host</code>.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<h3>Pipe</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vnd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VndPipe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PipeTransform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> fmt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NumberFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vi-VN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { style: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'currency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, currency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maximumFractionDigits: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '—'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Tạo <code>Intl.NumberFormat</code> một lần trong field — tạo mới mỗi lần <code>transform</code> là tốn.</p>\n<h3>Directive hành vi</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Directive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  selector: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[appCopy]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  host: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tabindex: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '[attr.aria-label]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"Sao chép \" + appCopy()'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '(click)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'copy()'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '(keydown.enter)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'copy()'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></spa